# tally 2.1.8 R14, L §5.10: each unit's reading has its own gap; explain's from: line for PLN states PLN's gap,
# not EUR's reading's at the same instant.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit USD: currency minor 0.01
kind wallets: place any signed
place broker: wallets lives 2025-01-01..

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  anchor broker
  opening[broker] = 1.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[broker] = 2.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[broker] = 4.00 EUR at 2026-02-15 end "s"
  stated[broker] = 3.00 PLN at 2026-02-15 end "s"

ask e: explain bal(broker, EUR, 2026-02-20)
ask p: explain bal(broker, PLN, 2026-02-20)
=== expect
e: 4.00 EUR
  balance of broker (EUR) at the end of 2026-02-20
  from: anchor v1:stated[broker] 2026-02-15 end = 4.00 EUR, 2026-02-15 end (version v1, source s, locator "s"), gap role anchor, gap 3.00 EUR
  no movement
  anchor: broker 2026-02-15 end, stated 4.00 EUR, difference 3.00 EUR
  cut 2026-06-10
p: 3.00 PLN
  balance of broker (PLN) at the end of 2026-02-20
  from: anchor v1:stated[broker] 2026-02-15 end = 3.00 PLN, 2026-02-15 end (version v1, source s, locator "s"), gap role anchor, gap 1.00 PLN
  no movement
  anchor: broker 2026-02-15 end, stated 3.00 PLN, difference 1.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-10
